{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1086602-combat-fear-tilt","id":1086602,"title":"Combat Fear (Tilt)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-02T06:53:25-07:00","id":1086602,"title":"Combat Fear (Tilt)","content":"My take on adding some consistency and layer of gravity to combat situations. What do you think?<br /> <br /> <b>Combat Fear (Environmental Tilt)</b><br /> This is a Tilt for combat experienced characters such as soldiers, gang members or active law enforcers. Level of this Tilt acts as a penalty to all rolls and represents unhealthy stress that clouds judgment or hinders actions. Spend Willpower point to make a reflexive Resolve + Composure roll penalized by Combat Fear. At 4th and 5th level this roll is mandatory and if character has no spare Willpower points automatically suffers effects of a Dramatic Failure.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><b>Ex. Success:</b> In addition to Success get all WP spend on a roll back <u>and gain one more on top of that.</u><br /> <b>Success:</b> You are unaffected by the Tilt for the rest of the scene or to the moment when higher level of threat is introduced.<br /> <b>F</b><b>ailure:</b> You are still affected by the Tilt.<br /> <b>Dramatic Failure:</b> In addition to effects of Combat Fear gain Beaten Down Tilt.</div>Alternatively spend Willpower point to get rid of the Tilt for a <i>turn.</i><br /> <br /> Threat Levels:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Minimally afraid - minorly over matched in combat; a minimally dangerous creature.</li> <li>Moderately afraid - over matched in combat; a dangerously aggressive creature.</li> <li>Very afraid - battlefield combat; a pack of aggressive creatures; a major threat to safety and a moderate fear for life.</li> <li>Mortally afraid - terrifyingly intense combat; confronting a large and dangerous creature such as a hippo; overwhelming fear for life.</li> <li>Utterly terrified - a hopeless situation; combat against incomprehensible things; fear so crippling that sanity cracks.</li> </ol><b>Causing the Tilt:</b> Getting into a situation where one can be physically harmed by opposing forces.<br /> <b>Ending the Tilt:</b> Catch a breath without enemies on your back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":1747,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","user":"Moinen","date":". 05-03-2017, 06:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T03:23:35-07:00","id":1087077,"title":"","content":"Fear can be invigorating so I'm changing effects of Ex. Success: and gain one on top of that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}